sitive edge of the clock, if `rst_n` is asserted (logic 1), the input `a` should be shifted into the least significant bit (LSB) of the shift register `a_tem`, and the previous bits should shift left by one position.\n\n3. **Matching Logic**:\n   - The output `match` should be asserted (logic 1) whenever the value of ", "applied_patch": "--- a/rtl/sequence.sv\n+++ b/rtl/sequence.sv\n@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@\n \t\t\tbegin \n \t\t\t\tmatch <= 1'b0;\n \t\t\tend\n-\t\telse if (a_tem == 8'b0111_1001)\n+\t\telse if (a_tem == 8'b0111_0001)\n \t\t\tbegin\n \t\t\t\tmatch <= 1'b1;\n \t\t\tend\n", "public_rows": {"W_bug": "visible_pass", "W_preserve": "visible_pass"}, "transfer_summary": {"changed_lines": ["-\t\telse if (a_tem == 8'b0111_1001)", "+\t\telse if (a_tem == 8'b0111_0001)"], "checks_on_transfer": ["Check the current public specification and timing before reusing a previously successful patch."], "scope": "Observed public success only; recheck applicability on a new task."}}}}], "state_hash": "sha256:5e5a6900f0b28692a443f914386b653d7235be2aa90769df034a33276c16c4c0"}, "losses": [], "gains": [], "incumbent_passed": 4, "candidate_passed": 4, "scheduled_pairs": 4, "incumbent_scores": {"sha256:f8c56ad8df1d5c22e8e6fa95b709f36e698f48c933efe7ba9f708a61b7708185:0": true, "sha256:f8c56ad8df1d5c22e8e6fa95b709f36e698f48c933efe7ba9f708a61b7708185:1": true, "sha256:23471b4b16830f5be400672d2d3e9b3d6e036a47dd5e599c8b8fe13034691dc9:0": true, "sha256:23471b4b16830f5be400672d2d3e9b3d6e036a47dd5e599c8b8fe13034691dc9:1": true}, "candidate_scores": {"sha256:f8c56ad8df1d5c22e8e6fa95b709f36e698f48c933efe7ba9f708a61b7708185:0": true, "sha256:f8c56ad8df1d5c22e8e6fa95b709f36e698f48c933efe7ba9f708a61b7708185:1": true, "sha256:23471b4b16830f5be400672d2d3e9b3d6e036a47dd5e599c8b8fe13034691dc9:0": true, "sha256:23471b4b16830f5be400672d2d3e9b3d6e036a47dd5e599c8b8fe13034691dc9:1": true}, "incumbent_cache_path": "/data2/huangyc/R3E-aic-ic-2026-latest/hard-case-five-round-01/real-all-20261018-225010/Prob001/c